.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
.Dd @NCOLLECTD_DATE@
.Dt NCOLLECTD-SYSTEMD_RESOLVED 5
.Os ncollectd @NCOLLECTD_VERSION@
.Sh NAME
.Nm ncollectd-systemd_resolved
.Nd Documentation of ncollectd's systemd_resolved plugin
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Bd -literal -compact
\fBload-plugin\fP systemd_resolved
\fBplugin\fP systemd_resolved {
    \fBsocket-path\fP \fIpath\fP
}
.Ed
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The \fBsystemd_resolved\fP plugin collects statistics from
\fBsystemd-resolved\fP.
It calls the \fIio.systemd.Resolve.Monitor.DumpStatistics\fP varlink method,
available since systemd 252.
The monitor socket is only accessible by root.
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It \fBsocket-path\fP \fIpath\fP
Path of the systemd-resolved monitor varlink socket.
Defaults to \fI/run/systemd/resolve/io.systemd.Resolve.Monitor\fP.
.El
.Sh "SEE ALSO"
.Xr ncollectd 1 ,
.Xr ncollectd.conf 5
